# Terrific Team-Up {3}{G}: "One or two target creatures you control each get +1/+0 until end of turn. They each deal damage equal to their power to target creature an
# opponent controls." No permanent of Bot1's has mana value 4 or greater, so it costs the full {4} (four Moxen, all tapped). Bot1 targets a Grizzly Bears (2/2) and a
# Llanowar Elves (1/1): they become 3/2 and 2/1 - the pump is power only - and deal 3 and 2, together 5, to Bot2's Wall of Stone (0/8), whose damage is 5. Back on turn 4
# the pump is gone: Bears 2/2 and Elves 1/1 again.

